  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the newest update, Parameter Drivers seem to execute three times for the local user (likely due to being duplicated on the local Mirror and Shadow Clone). This breaks animators using Add type Parameter Drivers, for example here, where transitioning to a single state that adds 0.2 to a Float parameter sets it to 0.6. I have also noticed issues with Bool parameters flipping unexpectedly in animator setups with instant transitions to Parameter Drivers, suggesting the three executions may be getting spread across multiple frames.",
